<Page title="Privacy Policy | MySpaFilter" description="MySpaFilter privacy policy: what data is collected, cookies, and affiliate partners.">
<h1>Privacy policy</h1><p><em>Last updated: October 23, 2026</em></p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2><p>MySpaFilter has no accounts, sign-ups, or comment forms, and we don't ask for personal information. The size lookup runs entirely in your browser, and nothing you type into it is sent to us.</p>
<h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process standard request data, such as IP address, browser type, and pages requested, for security and performance. See Cloudflare's privacy policy.</p>
<h2>Affiliate partners and cookies</h2><p>This site sets no tracking cookies of its own. Clicking a retailer link (for example Amazon, FiltersFast, or Doheny's) takes you to that retailer's site, and the retailer or its affiliate network (such as Amazon Associates or Awin) may set cookies to attribute a purchase. Their own privacy policies cover those cookies.</p>
<h2>Children</h2><p>This site is not directed to children under 13.</p>
<h2>Changes and contact</h2><p>We'll post any updates to this policy on this page. For questions, email <a href="mailto:contact@myspafilter.com">contact@myspafilter.com</a> or see <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>.</p>
</Page>
